1
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:53,120
Mother, you must help me.

2
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:54,610
Don't worry.

3
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:56,760
I will figure something out for you.

4
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:00,100
Master,

5
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:01,090
look at this.

6
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:02,940
We've raised a troublemaker.

7
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,019
It's infuriating.

8
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:06,520
I just couldn't stand seeing

9
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:08,080
Xue Ruowan marry into the General's Manor,

10
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:09,800
so I set a fire

11
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,520
in Ning Yuanci's residence.

12
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:12,800
Did you really set the fire

13
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:14,130
at the General's Manor?

14
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:15,000
Yes,

15
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,860
and I ran away right after.

16
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,600
Ning Yuanci is so heartless.

17
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:20,620
He actually used me as his spy.

18
00:01:21,039 --> 00:01:22,300
And that Xue Ruowan...

19
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,720
She thinks marrying Ning Yuanci

20
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:24,560
is such a big

21
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,120
deal.

22
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:27,100
What a despicable couple.

23
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:29,520
You even dared to set a fire.

24
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:30,240
Are you going to

25
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:31,300
kill someone next?

26
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,640
So what if I do?

27
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:35,380
I'll kill whoever Father tells me to.

28
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,729
Stop talking nonsense.

29
00:01:36,759 --> 00:01:37,920
Walls have ears.

30
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,060
I will handle this.

31
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,280
Just say

32
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:46,280
you went to your grandfather's to recover.

33
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:48,610
Ning Yuanci is already suspicious of you.

34
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:49,850
You must be careful.

35
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:52,320
I know, Father.

36
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:55,960
By the way, Father,

37
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:58,020
my painting and calligraphy theater

38
00:01:58,039 --> 00:01:59,080
is almost ready.

39
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,200
When it opens,

40
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:02,160
bring some people to support me.

41
00:02:02,240 --> 00:02:04,040
You are a lady of noble birth.

42
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:04,960
How can you

43
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,930
show your face in public so easily?

44
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,680
You like painting and calligraphy.

45
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,639
You can exchange ideas

46
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:11,080
with enthusiasts there.

47
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,080
Besides,

48
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:14,160
there are many people in the theater.

49
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:16,020
It's convenient for networking,

50
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:17,240
which will also help

51
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,440
your career, Father.

52
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,520
Watch me drug you

53
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,650
with a magic potion.

54
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:29,210
Lady Keying,

55
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:30,930
I finally get to see you.

56
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:33,280
Chu Qingjun,

57
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:35,650
are you alright?

58
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:36,920
I haven't seen you for days.

59
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:38,520
I've been worried about you.

60
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,120
Why did you come to the Duke's Residence?

61
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,760
Do you know

62
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:42,160
how dangerous it is here?

63
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,840
Ning Yuanci kindly let you out.

64
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,280
You should hurry home and stay there.

65
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,810
I haven't seen you for days,

66
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:48,800
but my mind

67
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,260
is filled with your image.

68
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:51,720
Lady Keying,

69
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,600
love arises unexpectedly

70
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,520
and runs deep.

71
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:55,940
My feelings for you

72
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:56,920
are genuine.

73
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,660
Forget about Ning Yuanci.

74
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,010
Don't

75
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:01,920
misuse your devoted male lead

76
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:02,960
persona.

77
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,440
If Chu Qingyun really falls for me

78
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:06,560
and ruins the plot,

79
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,280
I'm doomed.

80
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,280
If the old fox finds out

81
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,960
Ning Yuanci let Chu Qingyun go,

82
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,000
he might get suspicious.

83
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,240
For a scholar like you,

84
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,560
Ning Yuanci letting you go

85
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,200
means he thinks you're worthless.

86
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:20,060
Let me tell you,

87
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,280
there's no position for you
in the Duke's estate either.

88
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:22,920
Get out.

89
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,160
Ying'er.

90
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:28,360
I invited Mr. Chu here.

91
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,720
Mr. Chu remained unyielding

92
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:31,920
even under Ning Yuanci's

93
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:33,360
severe torture.

94
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,520
I invited him today

95
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:37,320
to help you

96
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:39,410
run the entertainment house well.

97
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:40,890
He is very talented.

98
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,240
I admire him a lot.

99
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:45,200
Thank you for giving me
a new life, Your Grace.

100
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:45,680
I

101
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,329
will definitely do my best to help.

102
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,560
What?

103
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:51,640
What is that old fox

104
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:53,000
up to?

105
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,520
I advise you not to waste your time

106
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,400
on me.

107
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,850
This is not something you should be doing.

108
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,400
Ning Yuanci isn't the only one

109
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,440
in this world

110
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,650
who can protect you.

111
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:08,680
I can do it too.

112
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,600
I like things I earn

113
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:11,880
through my own efforts.

114
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:14,200
I don't like those
who throw themselves at me.

115
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:15,400
Can you do something useful

116
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,560
with your time?

117
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,680
You can't even tell friend from foe.

118
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,279
What am I going to do with you?

119
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:21,920
Although I don't have

120
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:24,250
the power and influence of Ning Yuanci...

121
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:26,720
Trust me.

122
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:28,180
I will work hard

123
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,200
to be a man worthy

124
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:29,840
of you.

125
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:46,880
If the relationships

126
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:48,280
keep getting this messy,

127
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:48,880
I won't know

128
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:49,920
how to end this.

129
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:53,040
Does your heart ache for him?

130
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,240
Why are you here?

131
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:57,450
Aren't you afraid
the old fox will see you?

132
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:59,640
How does it feel to be pestered

133
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:00,240
by a man?

134
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,280
Are you jealous?

135
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:05,880
Me, jealous?

136
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,860
He doesn't deserve it.

137
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:11,370
As expected,

138
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:13,770
you were lying when you said you cared.

139
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:16,980
Are you crying?

140
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:20,400
No.

141
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:22,680
Hearing him say he likes you,

142
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,080
of course I'd be jealous.

143
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,400
I wish I could stab him twice.

144
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,320
Stop crying.

145
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:29,880
I was wrong.

146
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:35,880
Don't forget,

147
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:36,920
I can cry

148
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,400
or laugh whenever I want.

149
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,760
You just love acting to trick me,

150
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:41,320
don't you?

151
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:41,800
Yeah.

152
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,400
What's wrong?

153
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,659
Are you mad?

154
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,380
I was tricking you too.

155
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,860
How dare you, Ning Yuanci!

156
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,170
Once the theater opens,

157
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:06,680
Xue Shiyan

158
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:07,560
will probably use this place

159
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,120
to pass on intelligence.

160
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:11,240
We need to be more careful
with our actions

161
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,080
from now on.

162
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,840
We can't let them find out

163
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:15,440
we're conspiring together.

164
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:18,880
What are you thinking about?

165
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:21,280
Did Chu Qingyun take the initiative

166
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:22,940
to show goodwill to Xue Shiyan

167
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,600
just to get close to you?

168
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:27,920
Can you stop thinking

169
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,160
like a jealous lover?

170
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,520
It must be Xue Shiyan's scheme.

171
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,409
I have to keep a close eye on him.

172
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:37,840
Besides, based on what I know about

173
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,760
Chu Qingyun,

174
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,520
he wouldn't

175
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:43,180
help Xue Shiyan do bad things.

176
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,300
You know him very well.

177
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:49,200
Even if Chu Qingyun

178
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:51,400
deliberately tries to get close to you,

179
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,400
you're not allowed to talk to him.

180
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:54,260
Did you hear me?

181
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:56,800
You're a married man.

182
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,240
What right do you have

183
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,770
to tell me what men I can see?

184
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:02,600
Your sister has already accepted

185
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,000
the divorce letter I wrote her.

186
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,520
I can announce it to the world at any time

187
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:06,580
and then marry you.

188
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:11,010
Who said I'm going to marry you?

189
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:12,290
Besides,

190
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,120
a happy ending

191
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:18,200
doesn't have to end in marriage.

192
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:20,280
My primary task is

193
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:22,040
to protect Xue Ruowan

194
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:25,520
and help her gain freedom and happiness.

195
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:27,360
As for you,

196
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:30,800
go avenge

197
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,520
your family and friends.

198
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:35,920
Then move on from the past

199
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,260
and welcome a new life.

200
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,000
When everything is over,

201
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,200
are you

202
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,480
going back to your own world?

203
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,240
If I fail,

204
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,200
I won't be able to go back.

205
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:58,000
I might even disappear completely.

206
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,440
Who knows who I'll become

207
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:03,480
in the next reincarnation.

208
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:05,760
You might not even recognize me.

209
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:08,970
Don't worry.

210
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,420
As long as I'm here,

211
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:13,300
I won't let you disappear.

212
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:16,240
At first,

213
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,480
I thought I kept failing

214
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,360
because I didn't understand

215
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,480
this world.

216
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,520
Later I realized that

217
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:24,880
even if I followed the rules,

218
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,840
this world still wouldn't

219
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,280
run according to my will.

220
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,040
So,

221
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,360
I've decided.

222
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,000
From now on,

223
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,960
I'm going to follow my heart

224
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,559
and be myself to the fullest.

225
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,900
Although the ending
might not be rewritten,

226
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,679
the choice of
how each chapter is presented

227
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:44,440
is in our hands.

228
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:46,640
We need to fully

229
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:48,500
immerse ourselves in the moment.

230
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:49,400
And act it out

231
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:50,920
to the fullest.

232
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,080
No matter what the ending is,

233
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,930
I'll stay with you till the end.

234
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:19,760
Congratulations!

235
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:20,280
Wishing you a prosperous business!

236
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:20,960
Welcome.

237
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:22,760
Come, let's go inside.

238
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:23,360
Welcome.

239
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:23,880
Thank you.

240
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:24,720
Congratulations.

241
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,400
Welcome.

242
00:09:25,560 --> 00:09:26,240
Congratulations. Thank you.

243
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,120
Please take a seat inside.

244
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,160
Let's go inside.

245
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:28,760
Come on in.

246
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:29,320
Welcome.

247
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,840
Come, have a seat inside.

248
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,040
Father, you're here.

249
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:33,800
Let's go.

250
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:34,560
This way, please.

251
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:35,420
Please come in.

252
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:36,410
Sit down.

253
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:39,930
Please, sit.

254
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,400
What do you think?

255
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,460
This is my theater.

256
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:46,480
Not bad.

257
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,490
Why are you here?

258
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:54,240
I don't recall inviting you.

259
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,680
Have you forgotten, Sister?

260
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:56,800
I also poured my heart

261
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,360
into this theater.

262
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:00,760
Wan'er,

263
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:03,800
it's good that you still care
about your family.

264
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:05,760
My wife has been unwell since

265
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:06,820
she was frightened

266
00:10:06,880 --> 00:10:08,520
by the fire on our wedding night.

267
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:09,400
I insisted she

268
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:11,060
stay in the residence to rest.

269
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:13,340
Father-in-law, please understand.

270
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:16,930
Last time I rushed over
to demand her back,

271
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,640
it was out of concern.

272
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:19,570
General,

273
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,240
please don't mind it.

274
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,240
Useless people

275
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,400
are just so dramatic.

276
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,960
She is truly valiant.

277
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:05,000
Your performance of Mulan joining the army

278
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,400
is truly spectacular, Sister.

279
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:06,880
Look,

280
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,360
every move she makes

281
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:10,000
truly has the bearing of a female general.

282
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:12,040
Ying'er was spoiled since childhood,

283
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:14,300
yet she has grown much more sensible now.

284
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,840
and are willing to share my burdens.

285
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:20,200
Seeing a woman don armor

286
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,640
and bravely kill enemies,

287
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,960
My Lord Duke, did it not remind you

288
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,480
of your own military years?
